455:- **Wear:** every data sector is written once per lap of the card (4 GB at 64,000 bytes per second is about 16 hours of audio per lap [CALC, architecture 16.4]); index sectors once per record; the superblock 2 times per recording, alternating between 2 sectors. The card's own wear levelling (its controller) is not documented for the CSNP32GCR01-BOW (section 10.5).
